---
const individualPoints = [
  'Space to reflect clearly and honestly',
  'Support with boundaries, confidence and communication',
  'A sustainable way to lead without losing yourself',
];
const organisationPoints = [
  'Leadership wellbeing and sustainable performance',
  'Communication, psychological safety and mediation',
  'Healthier cultures that support people and outcomes',
];
---
<section
  class="about-authority"
  aria-labelledby="foundation-heading"
>
  <div class="container-fluid bg-canvas pb-5">
    <div class="container py-5">
      <div class="row mb-4">
        <div class="col-12">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-3 text-uppercase fw-bold">
            The foundation
          </p>
          <h2
            id="foundation-heading"
            class="display-2 mb-0"
          >
            A foundation built on lived experience, training
            and insight.
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row mb-5">
        <div class="col-12">
          <p class="fs-4 lh-lg text-body-secondary mb-0">
            Annette's authority is not built on theory alone.
            It comes from years of leadership, professional
            training and practical work with people navigating
            real pressure and change.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-5">
        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
          <article class="audience-block position-relative h-100 ps-4">
            <span
              class="audience-block__dot position-absolute rounded-circle"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
            <p class="audience-block__label mb-3 text-uppercase fw-bold">
              For individual leaders
            </p>
            <h3 class="mb-3">
              Clarity, confidence and grounded leadership.
            </h3>
            <p class="audience-block__body mb-0">
              One-to-one work gives leaders room to think clearly,
              understand what needs to change and move forward
              with confidence.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-unstyled mt-4 mb-0">
              {individualPoints.map((point) => (
                <li class="position-relative py-2 ps-4">{point}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <a
              href="/individuals/"
              class="hero__button hero__button--primary mt-4"
            >
              For Individuals
              <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
          <article class="audience-block position-relative h-100 ps-4">
            <span
              class="audience-block__dot position-absolute rounded-circle"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
            <p class="audience-block__label mb-3 text-uppercase fw-bold">
              For teams & organisations
            </p>
            <h3 class="mb-3">
              Healthier cultures. Stronger outcomes.
            </h3>
            <p class="audience-block__body mb-0">
              Annette also works at team and organisational level,
              helping create the conditions in which people can
              perform without wellbeing becoming collateral damage.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-unstyled mt-4 mb-0">
              {organisationPoints.map((point) => (
                <li class="position-relative py-2 ps-4">{point}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <a
              href="/organisations/"
              class="hero__button hero__button--secondary mt-4"
            >
              For Organisations
              <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
